<title>USA: Commerce Bancshares buys 401,567 shares.</title>
<headline>Commerce Bancshares buys 401,567 shares.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Bancshares Inc said during the third quarter it continued its share repurchase program, retiring into treasury 401,567 shares.</p>
<p>At September 30, it had 36.3 million shares outstanding compared to 38.3 million in the same year-ago quarter.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
